{"version":1,"content":"<p>日前美國俄亥俄州立大學團隊在《Science Advances》發佈研究成果。他們推出一套名為Scentronic的遠程氣味傳輸系統，依靠可穿戴接收裝置，首次實現氣味數碼化後通過網絡遠程復現，讓跨距離「傳香味」從設想走向實驗室驗證階段。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1583560.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:04:42.765842+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T11:31:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.861481+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T12:58:11.861481+00:00","content_hash":"82e905c2d849b8708cdc6a7e50813b5dc059790e2cddfc770e30424b1195e049","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}